ater\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_exit_verification_reason_for_forfeiting_submit\\\":\\\"Submit Feedback\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_exit_verification_reason_for_forfeiting_skip\\\":\\\"Skip KYC\\\",\\\"mc_merkle_copytrade_robottrade\\\":\\\"Copy Trade \\u0026 Trading Bot\\\",\\\"mc_merkle_prediction\\\":\\\"Prediction Market\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_choose_country_canda_quebec_not_support\\\":\\\"Services are not available to residents of Quebec due to regulatory requirements\\\",\\\"mc_openapi_prompt_1_no_doc\\\":\\\"1. Each user can create up to {max} API keys. COREX currently supports major cryptos along with 120+ other tokens. \\u003ca1\\u003eView more\\u003c/a1\\u003e.\\\",\\\"mc_openapi_tip_4_no_link\\\":\\\"Dear COREXer, to further enhance platform liquidity and your trading experience, COREX is launching the Market Maker Program for Spot and Futures. Top market makers are invited to apply.\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_person_auth_info_update_kyc\\\":\\\"Update ID Document\\\",\\\"mc_security_reset_risk_control_title\\\":\\\"Reminder\\\",\\\"mc_security_reset_risk_control_desc\\\":\\\"Modification of security settings (phone, email, or Google Authenticator) is currently not supported. Please complete the account risk review.\\\",\\\"mc_security_reset_risk_control_proceed\\\":\\\"Proceed\\\",\\\"mc_security_reset_apply_success_deadline\\\":\\\"Customer Service will process your application by {time}. Please stay tuned for email or SMS notifications.\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_completed_reward_tips\\\":\\\"Get \\u003cspan\\u003e{amount} USDT\\u003c/span\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_completed_loss_coverage\\\":\\\"Get \\u003cspan\\u003e{amount} USDT\\u003c/span\\u003e loss coverage\\\",\\\"mc_user_vip_alpha_level_elite_program\\\":\\\"Your Alpha Trader level: {level}. Alpha Trader is an exclusive tiered program for MEXC Elite users, upgraded from the original VIP program. It offers higher‑tier benefits and services. \\u003cdiv\\u003eLearn more \\u003e\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_trade_vip_alpha_trader_program\\\":\\\"What is the Alpha Trader program?\\\",\\\"mc_trade_vip_alpha_vs_vvip\\\":\\\"What is the difference between Alpha Trader and VVIP?\\\",\\\"mc_trade_vip_current_alpha_level\\\":\\\"Your current Alpha Trader level: {level}\\\",\\\"mc_trade_vip_customer_service\\\":\\\"Customer Service\\\",\\\"mc_trade_vip_evaluation_dimensions\\\":\\\"They evaluate users from different dimensions:\\u003cdiv1\\u003e• Alpha Trader: Levels based on trading performance\\u003c/div1\\u003e\\u003cdiv2\\u003e• VVIP: Levels based on assets and overall account performance\\u003c/div2\\u003e\\u003cdiv3\\u003eThe platform combines both programs to match you with the most suitable benefits and services.\\u003c/div3\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_trade_vip_my_performance\\\":\\\"My Performance\\\",\\\"mc_trade_vip_my_vvip\\\":\\\"View My VVIP\\\",\\\"mc_trade_vip_nonzero_fee_vol_last_month\\\":\\\"Non‑0‑Fee Vol (Last Month)\\\",\\\"mc_trade_vip_nonzero_fee_vol_month\\\":\\\"Non‑0‑Fee Vol (This Month)\\\",\\\"mc_trade_vip_tiered_trading_program\\\":\\\"Alpha Trader is a tiered program based on trading performance. The program classifies you into levels A1–A7 according to your trading data. The more active you are, the higher your level and the more extensive your benefits.\\\",\\\"mc_trade_vip_upgrade_better_services\\\":\\\"To provide more refined and better‑matched services, we've upgraded the original VIP program. The new program reflects your trading capability and account value more comprehensively.\\\",\\\"mc_trade_vip_upgrade_changes\\\":\\\"What changes with the upgrade?\\\",\\\"mc_trade_vip_upgrade_details\\\":\\\"View Upgrade Details\\\",\\\"mc_trade_vip_upgrade_reason\\\":\\\"Why is the VIP program being upgraded?\\\",\\\"mc_trade_vip_vip_upgrade_alpha_trader\\\":\\\"VIP Program Upgrading to \\u003cdiv\\u003eAlpha Trader\\u003c/div\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_trade_vip_vip_upgrade_notice\\\":\\\"To provide more tailor‑made benefits and services, we've upgraded the VIP program, now powered by both Alpha Trader and the VVIP M‑Score. Alpha Trader matches your level and benefits based on your trading performance. While the page is being updated, your benefits are subject to the official announcement.\\\",\\\"mc_trade_vip_zero_fee_included\\\":\\\"After the upgrade, your level will be defined more clearly, and 0‑fee trading volume will also be included in your statistics, allowing us to offer more targeted benefits and services.\\\",\\\"mc_trade_vip_zero_fee_vol_last_month\\\":\\\"0‑Fee Vol (Last Month)\\\",\\\"mc_trade_vip_zero_fee_vol_month\\\":\\\"0‑Fee Vol (This Month)\\\",\\\"mc_home_seo_title_kr\\\":\\\"COREX:The leading crypto exchange for trending tokens with superior liquidity\\\",\\\"mc_home_seo_description_kr\\\":\\\"Discover COREX—the premier crypto exchange for trending tokens, built with deep liquidity, fast execution, and trusted infrastructure for modern traders.\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_address_proof_file_support_file14\\\":\\\"ID card, passport, driver's license, residence permit\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_address_proof_file_not_support_file4_new2_no_screenshot\\\":\\\"Unsupported document types: purchase receipts / medical bills\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_additional_box_option_fiat_not_support_id_doc\\\":\\\"I understand that for fiat transactions, ID cards, driver's licenses, passports, and residence permits are not accepted as proof of address\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_fund_proof_title\\\":\\\"Source of Funds\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_fund_proof_file_type_desc_2\\\":\\\"Please ensure all documents are genuine and valid. Submitting forged or misleading documents may result in your account being restricted from verification or temporarily frozen\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_fund_proof_file_type_desc_date\\\":\\\"the issuance date must be within the last 3 months (between {startDate} and {endDate})\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_fund_proof_file_type_title\\\":\\\"Source of Funds Document Types\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_fund_proof_file_type_desc_1\\\":\\\"Please provide one of the following source of funds documents\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_fund_proof_file_bank_statement\\\":\\\"Bank statement\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_fund_proof_file_payslip\\\":\\\"Payslip / salary statement\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_fund_proof_file_inheritance\\\":\\\"Inheritance certificate / probate document\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_fund_proof_file_asset_transaction\\\":\\\"Documents for asset sale, rental, or financing\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_fund_proof_file_investment\\\":\\\"Investment proof (e.g., stocks, funds, fixed‑income products, or large certificates of deposit)\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_fund_proof_file_employment\\\":\\\"Employment proof (with bank statement or payslip)\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_fund_proof_file_tax_return\\\":\\\"Tax return / tax assessment\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_additional_auth_info_title\\\":\\\"Provide the required information to enjoy worry‑free trading\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_address_proof_file\\\":\\\"Proof of address document\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_address_stock_update_reason_label\\\":\\\"Reason for Update\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_address_stock_update_reason_placeholder\\\":\\\"Select a reason for update\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_address_stock_update_reason_address_changed\\\":\\\"Residential address changed\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_address_stock_update_reason_doc_expired\\\":\\\"Original document expired\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_address_stock_update_reason_fiat_channel\\\":\\\"Documents must be updated to meet specific channel requirements\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_address_stock_update_reason_name_mismatch\\\":\\\"Name on document does not match verified identity\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_fund_proof_update_reason_doc_expired\\\":\\\"Current document expired\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_fund_proof_update_reason_source_changed\\\":\\\"Source of information changed\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_fund_proof_update_reason_info_changed\\\":\\\"User information changed\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_additional_box_option_2_no_screenshot\\\":\\\"I am not submitting a purchase receipt, medical bill, or similar document\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_fund_proof_result_retry\\\":\\\"Retry Verification\\\",\\\"mc_assets_phone\\\":\\\"Phone\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_upload_file_components_duplicate\\\":\\\"This file has been uploaded. No need to submit again.\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_upload_file_components_network_error\\\":\\\"Network error. Upload failed. Please check your connection and try again.\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_reset_key_form_reason_select_item_7\\\":\\\"The ID is invalid or expired (not accepted for Stock account opening)\\\",\\\"mc_user_security_reset_answer_1\\\":\\\"If you no longer have access to your email, phone, or Google Authenticator, please reset your security verification via the following methods:\\\",\\\"mc_user_security_reset_answer_2\\\":\\\"If you cannot receive verification codes from your old email, phone, or Google Authenticator, please reset your security verification via the following methods:\\\",\\\"mc_user_security_reset_answer_3\\\":\\\"You can unlink your email, phone, or Google Authenticator via the following methods (Note: Your account must remain linked to at least an email or a phone number):\\\",\\\"mc_user_security_reset_app_path\\\":\\\"App: Tap the Profile icon (top-left) → Security → Select security verification to unlink → Tap Security verification unavailable? to submit your request.\\\",\\\"mc_user_security_reset_question_1\\\":\\\"Email, phone, or Google Authenticator unavailable? How to reset security verification.\\\",\\\"mc_user_security_reset_question_2\\\":\\\"Lost phone or can't receive codes from old security verifications? How to reset.\\\",\\\"mc_user_security_reset_question_3\\\":\\\"How to unlink email, phone, or Google Authenticator?\\\",\\\"mc_user_security_reset_web_path_1\\\":\\\"Web: Please click \\u003ca\\u003eSecurity Verification Unavailable?\\u003c/a\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_user_security_reset_web_path_2\\\":\\\"Web: Please click \\u003ca\\u003eReset Your Security Verification\\u003c/a\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_user_security_reset_web_path_3\\\":\\\"Web: Please click \\u003ca\\u003eUnlink Security Verification\\u003c/a\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_overseas_chinese_head_title\\\":\\\"Overseas Chinese Verification\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_overseas_chinese_step_submit_doc\\\":\\\"Submit Documents\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_overseas_chinese_accepted_doc_types\\\":\\\"Accepted document types: ✅ ID card ✅ Passport ✅ Driver's license\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_overseas_chinese_step_face_recognition\\\":\\\"Facial Recognition\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_overseas_chinese_face_only_self\\\":\\\"Follow the prompts and do not let anyone else complete it for you\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_overseas_chinese_face_good_lighting\\\":\\\"Perform the verification in a well-lit environment and make sure your face is clearly visible\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_overseas_chinese_face_no_obstruction\\\":\\\"Remove all facial obstructions, including hats, masks, or sunglasses\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_overseas_chinese_face_no_proxy\\\":\\\"Make sure your network and device are ready, and keep your face within the frame\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_overseas_chinese_not_support_file_type\\\":\\\"Purchase receipts and medical bills are not accepted\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_overseas_chinese_not_support_reset_kyc_tips\\\":\\\"Self-service updates are not available for Overseas Chinese verification. Contact Customer Service to update your information.\\\",\\\"mc_merkle_proof_of_reserve_view_now\\\":\\\"View Now\\\",\\\"mc_openapi_permission_p2p\\\":\\\"P2P\\\",\\\"mc_user_openapi_permission_read\\\":\\\"Read\\\",\\\"mc_user_openapi_permission_p2p_view_account_and_order\\\":\\\"Read account \\u0026 order info\\\",\\\"mc_user_openapi_permission_p2p_place_order\\\":\\\"Place order\\\",\\\"mc_user_openapi_permission_p2p_advertisement\\\":\\\"Advertiser\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_auth_limit_tip_modal_title\\\":\\\"Notice\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_auth_limit_tip_modal_desc\\\":\\\"You've reached the attempt limit for Advanced KYC Verification\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_auth_limit_tip_modal_desc_poa\\\":\\\"You've reached the attempt limit for address verification\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_auth_limit_tip_modal_btn\\\":\\\"Lift Restriction\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_unlock_result_modal_success_title\\\":\\\"Restriction Lifted\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_unlock_result_modal_success_desc\\\":\\\"Submit clear, valid ID documents with your next verification attempt to help it pass\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_unlock_result_modal_success_desc_poa\\\":\\\"Submit clear, valid documents with your next verification attempt to help it pass\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_unlock_result_modal_pending_title\\\":\\\"Request Submitted\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_unlock_result_modal_pending_desc\\\":\\\"Your request has been submitted. You can resubmit your verification in 2 hours. \\u003cb\\u003eEstimated availability: {time} (UTC+8).\\u003c/b\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_unlock_result_modal_btn\\\":\\\"Got It\\\",\\\"mc_user_openapi_permission_write_account_info\\\":\\\"Edit Account Info\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_senior_poa_reuse_title\\\":\\\"Authorize document for address verification\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_senior_poa_reuse_desc\\\":\\\"Your selected {country} {cardType} may already include your residential address. If enabled, the platform will use this document for address verification without requiring additional documents.\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_address_proof_id_card_support\\\":\\\"ID card, passport, driver's license, or residence permit with address\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_address_proof_id_card_front_back_hint\\\":\\\"When uploading an ID document with address, make sure to submit both the front and back\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_address_proof_notice_title\\\":\\\"Proof of address guidelines\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_address_proof_radio_placeholder\\\":\\\"Select document type\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_address_proof_notice_desc\\\":\\\"Learn about proof of address guidelines\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_choose_country_uae_dubai_not_support\\\":\\\"Services are not available to users in Dubai due to regulatory requirements\\\",\\\"mc_institution_auth_step3_restricted_country_tip\\\":\\\"The application will be rejected if any company shareholder or ultimate beneficial owner (UBO) is from a restricted or prohibited country/region\\\",\\\"mc_institution_auth_step4_lang_modal_title\\\":\\\"Notice\\\",\\\"mc_institution_auth_step4_lang_modal_content\\\":\\\"All official documents must be submitted in English or with a certified English translation\\\",\\\"mc_institution_auth_step4_lang_modal_btn\\\":\\\"Got It\\\",\\\"mc_institution_auth_step4_offshore_tip\\\":\\\"If the company is registered in an offshore jurisdiction, provide a Certificate of Incumbency issued within the last 6 months and certified by a qualified third-party\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_address_proof_file_upload_select_country_first\\\":\\\"Select a country/region before uploading a file\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_poi_invalid_modal_title\\\":\\\"KYC Verification Expired\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_poi_invalid_modal_desc\\\":\\\"Your KYC verification has expired. Update it to continue.\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_poi_invalid_modal_btn\\\":\\\"Update KYC\\\",\\\"mc_user_security_new_bind_tr_advanced_kyc_required\\\":\\\"To transfer to MEXC TR, complete Advanced KYC first\\\",\\\"mc_user_security_new_bind_tr_desc\\\":\\\"MEXC TR account linking only allows cross-platform transfers between MEXC and MEXC TR via the withdrawal function. Once linked, it cannot be unlinked. Make sure you've completed Advanced KYC before linking.\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_activity_banner_title\\\":\\\"Alpha Trader Exclusive Events\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_contact_label\\\":\\\"Contact Info\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_contact_note\\\":\\\"After submitting the form, a dedicated Alpha Trader relationship manager will contact you within 3-5 business days for KYC verification. You can also reach out to us directly via the following methods.\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_contact_us\\\":\\\"Contact Us\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_contact_value_placeholder\\\":\\\"Enter your contact info\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_error_contact_required\\\":\\\"Enter contact information\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_error_contact_too_long\\\":\\\"Maximum 50 characters\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_error_image_count\\\":\\\"Maximum {count} images allowed\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_error_image_required\\\":\\\"Please upload an image\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_error_image_size\\\":\\\"Image must not exceed 10 MB\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_error_image_type\\\":\\\"Incorrect image format\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_error_remark_too_long\\\":\\\"Maximum 100 characters\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_how_desc\\\":\\\"If your trading volume or asset size on other major exchanges meets the MEXC Alpha Trader requirements, we will match your status and grant you an upgraded (+1 level) Alpha Trader experience\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_how_step1\\\":\\\"1. Log in to retrieve your MEXC UID\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_how_step2\\\":\\\"2. Select a contact method\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_how_step3\\\":\\\"3. Upload valid VIP proof and submit\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_how_title\\\":\\\"How to Apply\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_images_format_hint\\\":\\\"Supports PNG, JPG, and JPEG formats only. Maximum 10 MB per image. Up to {count} images.\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_pending_desc\\\":\\\"Application successfully submitted. Please do not resubmit.\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_pending_title\\\":\\\"Application under review. Please do not resubmit.\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_remark_placeholder\\\":\\\"Remarks\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_special_desc\\\":\\\"Your account type is restricted and ineligible for the Alpha Trader level\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_submit\\\":\\\"Submit\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_submit_success\\\":\\\"Submitted successfully\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_title\\\":\\\"Start Your Alpha Journey\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_uid_guest_placeholder\\\":\\\"Log in to retrieve UID\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_upload_desc\\\":\\\"Please upload screenshots of your VIP status on other exchanges, including \\u003cstrong\\u003eyour current VIP level, 30-day trading volume, and proof of assets\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_apply_upload_title\\\":\\\"Upload Proof\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_benefit_card_subtitle\\\":\\\"Get priority access to MEXC Card and enjoy seamless global payments\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_benefit_card_title\\\":\\\"MEXC Card\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_benefit_locked_toast\\\":\\\"Current level locked\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_benefit_more_subtitle\\\":\\\"Coming soon. Stay tuned.\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_benefit_more_title\\\":\\\"More exclusive Alpha privileges\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_benefit_service_subtitle\\\":\\\"Receive dedicated support, personalized rewards, and priority assistance\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_benefit_service_title\\\":\\\"Priority Support\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_benefit_title\\\":\\\"Alpha Trader Benefits\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_benefit_trading_subtitle\\\":\\\"Receive exclusive 0-fee quotas periodically to keep trading costs to a minimum\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_benefit_trading_title\\\":\\\"Trading Privileges\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_benefit_wealth_subtitle\\\":\\\"Access premium Earn products and advanced yield strategies\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_benefit_wealth_title\\\":\\\"MEXC Earn\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_exclusive_subtitle\\\":\\\"Join curated events and connect with fellow Alpha Traders around the world\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_exclusive_title\\\":\\\"The Alpha Circle\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_faq_a1\\\":\\\"Alpha Trader represents the highest level within the MEXC VVIP M-Score framework, a premium program crafted specifically for high-volume traders. The system categorizes users into levels from A1 to A7 based on trading performance. Higher levels unlock deeper fee discounts, dedicated support, and extensive privilege ecosystems.\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_faq_a2\\\":\\\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eReach VVIP Elite status (M-Score ≥ 800) and meet the trading volume requirement for your desired Alpha Trader level. Once you qualify, your level will be upgraded automatically.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eRegional restrictions, risk flags, market maker accounts, institutional accounts, and accounts that violate the platform's compliance policies are not eligible.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_faq_a3\\\":\\\"If you demonstrate exceptional trading volume but have not yet reached VVIP Elite status, you may still be eligible for a 1-month VVIP Elite Experience Card or a temporary Alpha Trader experience. Eligibility is subject to account review, compliance checks, and platform evaluation. Final approval is at MEXC's discretion.\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_faq_a4\\\":\\\"Levels are updated dynamically on a daily basis. The system upgrades you automatically once thresholds are met. Additionally, a comprehensive review is conducted at 16:00 (UTC) on the 1st of every month. Levels will be automatically adjusted if the rolling metrics fall short of the requirements.\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_faq_a5\\\":\\\"Trading volume includes Spot, Futures, and API. Please note that 0-fee and fee-paying trading volume are tracked and calculated separately.\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_faq_a6\\\":\\\"Benefits vary based on your level and overall account performance. The Alpha Trader program currently operates on a contact-to-activate basis. To activate your benefits and claim rewards, contact online support or your dedicated Alpha Manager via Telegram. Go to the MEXC homepage and click the Support icon in the bottom right corner.\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_faq_q1\\\":\\\"What is Alpha Trader?\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_faq_q2\\\":\\\"How do I become an Alpha Trader?\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_faq_q3\\\":\\\"What if my trading volume is high but my M-Score is below 800?\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_faq_q4\\\":\\\"How often are Alpha Trader levels updated?\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_faq_q5\\\":\\\"Which trades count toward Alpha Trader volume?\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_faq_q6\\\":\\\"What benefits can an Alpha Trader get?\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_faq_title\\\":\\\"Alpha Trader FAQ\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_hero_brand\\\":\\\"Alpha Trader\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_hero_cta_primary\\\":\\\"Become an Alpha Trader\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_hero_cta_secondary\\\":\\\"Unlock Your Alpha Level\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_hero_slogan\\\":\\\"Exclusive Rewards · Tailored Services · Long-Term Privileges\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_hero_title\\\":\\\"Join Our Elite Circle\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_level_card_blacklist_desc\\\":\\\"Your account type is restricted and ineligible for the Alpha Trader level\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_level_card_blacklist_title\\\":\\\"Non-Alpha User\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_level_card_current_level\\\":\\\"Your Alpha Trader Level\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_level_card_go_trade\\\":\\\"Trade Now\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_level_card_mscore\\\":\\\"Your M-Score\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_level_card_notes\\\":\\\"\\u003cli\\u003eAlpha Trader levels are assessed based on the cumulative trading volume for each calendar month. Accounts will be automatically upgraded the next day once the threshold is met.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eIf your trading volume falls below the requirement for your current level, your account will be automatically adjusted before 15:59 UTC on the 1st of each month.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_level_card_progress_standard_fee\\\":\\\"Non-0 fees volume\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_level_card_progress_zero_fee\\\":\\\"0-fee volume\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_level_card_standard_title\\\":\\\"Standard User\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_level_card_unlock_hint\\\":\\\"Reach your trading target to unlock the next level: {level}\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_rm_contact_button\\\":\\\"Contact Now\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_rm_contact_desc\\\":\\\"Contact us for premium support\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_rm_contact_reward\\\":\\\"Claim exclusive bespoke merchandise upon your first contact\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_rm_contact_title\\\":\\\"Your Alpha manager:\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_task_lottery_title\\\":\\\"Complete tasks to win grand prizes\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_terms_content\\\":\\\"$4b\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_terms_title\\\":\\\"Terms and Conditions\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_threshold_col_level\\\":\\\"Level\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_threshold_col_standard_fee\\\":\\\"30-Day Fee-Paying Trading Volume (Million USDT)\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_threshold_col_zero_fee\\\":\\\"30-Day 0-Fee Trading Volume (Million USDT)\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_threshold_note\\\":\\\"Alpha Trader level assessment criteria: Users who meet either the non-0 fees or 0 fees trading volume threshold for a specific level will be granted that level. Volumes are not cumulative; the higher achieved level will apply.\\u003cbr/\\u003eTrading volume calculations include: Spot trading, Futures trading, API trading, 0-fee trading volume, and sub-account volumes. Note: Users triggered by any platform risk control tags are ineligible for the Alpha Trader status.\\u003cbr/\\u003eLevel upgrades take effect the next day. The system will automatically upgrade your account once the volume requirement is met.\\u003cbr/\\u003eAt 16:00 on the 1st of each month (UTC), accounts failing to meet the threshold will be automatically downgraded\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_threshold_note_title\\\":\\\"Rules or Program Rules\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_threshold_title\\\":\\\"Alpha Trader Requirements\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_vip_transition_button\\\":\\\"View Now\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_vip_transition_subtitle\\\":\\\"Redirecting to the Alpha Trader landing page in {seconds}s\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_vip_transition_title\\\":\\\"MEXC VIP Revamped: Advance your M-Score and Alpha Trader level to join our elite circle and unlock premium privileges\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_level_card_mscore_desc\\\":\\\"Users must qualify as VVIP Elite (M-Score ≥ 800) before they can officially join the Alpha Trader program. Click to view Your M-Score.\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_level_card_notes_blacklist\\\":\\\"\\u003cli\\u003eUsers must reach VVIP Elite status (M-Score ≥ 800) and meet the trading volume requirement for the corresponding Alpha Trader level. Once qualified, the user's level will be upgraded automatically.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eRegional restrictions, risk flags, market maker accounts, institutional accounts, and accounts that violate the platform's compliance policies are not eligible.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\\",\\\"mc_assets_withdraw_custom_wait_tip\\\":\\\"Custom limits take 24 hours to take effect. Until then, withdrawals still require security verification. To help protect your assets, we may still require verification based on your account security status, even when Fast Withdrawal is enabled.\\\",\\\"mc_assets_withdraw_error_daily_over_max\\\":\\\"24-hour verification-free limit can't exceed {max} USDT\\\",\\\"mc_assets_withdraw_error_single_over_daily\\\":\\\"Per-transaction limit can't exceed the 24-hour verification-free limit\\\",\\\"mc_assets_withdraw_error_single_over_max\\\":\\\"Per-transaction verification-free limit can't exceed {max} USDT\\\",\\\"mc_assets_withdraw_input_placeholder\\\":\\\"Enter amount\\\",\\\"mc_assets_withdraw_limit_custom\\\":\\\"Custom Limit\\\",\\\"mc_assets_withdraw_limit_default\\\":\\\"Default Limit\\\",\\\"mc_user_security_anti_phishing_warning\\\":\\\"Never share your password, Google Authenticator code, or SMS verification code with anyone, including MEXC Support. Once an anti-phishing code is set, it will be included in all official emails from MEXC. If the code is missing or incorrect, the email may be a phishing attempt. Please stay vigilant.\\\",\\\"mc_assets_withdraw_protection_title\\\":\\\"Withdrawal Protection\\\",\\\"mc_assets_withdraw_protection_desc\\\":\\\"Once enabled, all on-chain withdrawals will be automatically rejected during the lock period.\\\",\\\"mc_assets_withdraw_protection_open_desc\\\":\\\"On-chain withdrawals will be automatically rejected during the lock period. Select lock duration:\\\",\\\"mc_assets_withdraw_protection_day\\\":\\\"{day}D\\\",\\\"mc_assets_withdraw_protection_open_success\\\":\\\"Withdrawal Protection Enabled\\\",\\\"mc_assets_withdraw_protection_early_unlock\\\":\\\"Unlock Early\\\",\\\"mc_assets_withdraw_protection_unlock_desc\\\":\\\"All on-chain withdrawals are automatically rejected during the lock period. Time remaining:\\\",\\\"mc_assets_withdraw_protection_unlock_success\\\":\\\"Unlocked Successfully\\\",\\\"mc_assets_withdraw_protection_countdown\\\":\\\"\\u003cspan\\u003e{day}\\u003c/span\\u003eD \\u003cspan\\u003e{hour}\\u003c/span\\u003eH \\u003cspan\\u003e{minute}\\u003c/span\\u003em \\u003cspan\\u003e{second}\\u003c/span\\u003es\\\",\\\"mc_id_auth_kyc_submit_success_minutes_tip\\\":\\\"Submitted successfully. The review will be completed within 5 minutes. Thank you for your patience.\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_next_alpha_level\\\":\\\"You are just one step away from the next Alpha Trader level! Complete the required trading volume to level up instantly and unlock higher-level exclusive privileges.\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_acknowledged\\\":\\\"Got It\\\",\\\"mc_alpha_trader_ai_avatar_notice\\\":\\\"Disclaimer: This avatar was generated by AI. If it resembles any existing avatar, contact Customer Service.\\\",\\\"mc_common_message_earn_events\\\":\\\"Earn Events\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_num_usdt_per_day\\\":\\\"{num} USDT per day\\\",\\\"mc_id_auth_withdraw_limit_usdt\\\":\\\"Increase your 24-hour withdrawal limit to {withdrawLimit} USDT\\\",\\\"mc_user_id_auth_num_20k_usd_per_day\\\":\\\"20K USD per day\\\",\\\"mc_assets_withdraw_verify_head\\\":\\\"Withdrawal verification\\\",\\\"mc_assets_withdraw_verify_input\\\":\\\"Last 4 characters of address\\\",\\\"mc_assets_withdraw_verify_placeholder\\\":\\\"Please enter the la